:: Observation Deck [nobr] {"position":"1000,500","size":"100,100"}
<div class="textbox">
    <<ctp "observation">>
	    The corridor opens into something vast. The far wall is entirely transparent. Beyond it — stars, and below them, the curve of Earth. Closer than it should feel.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
	    Rooms branch off on either side. A tall figure stands near the transparent wall, its surface pulsing slowly.
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Talk to the figure by the window|Watcher Observation Deck]]
