:: Right Button [nobr room1] {"position":"400,300","size":"100,100"}
<<set $compliance = $compliance+1>>

<div class="textbox">
    <div class="speaker">Narrator</div>
    <<ctp "rightButton">>
	    "You're feeling alive and well thankfully, that's one hurdle down. Now you need to move on from this room as there are some visitors you may not immediately recognise as conversable. But it's better to meet them on your own terms."
    <<ctpNext clear>>
	    "The door ahead of you will open in a moment. Step through when you're ready."
    <<ctpNext clear>>
	    "I should explain where you are. You're aboard a vessel. Not a human one. I know how that sounds. I need you to stay calm while I walk you through what's happened, because it's going to sound alarming and it isn't, you aren't in any actual danger as odd as that statement may appear."
    <<ctpNext clear>>
	    "What you're going to see in the corridor is going to be strange. I need you to remember that strange doesn't mean dangerous."
    <<ctpNext clear>>
	    "It's not going to hurt you."
    <<ctpNext clear>>
	    "I'll explain everything once you're moving ahead, that's how confident I am that you're going to be present in the next room and room after that."
    <<ctpNext clear>>
	    "Just follow the general directions."
    <<ctpNext clear>>
        <div class="choice">
            [[Step into the hallway|Hallway #1]]
        </div>
  <</ctp>>
</div>



